How We Do It Step-by-Step

Find the middle (Fast & Slow Pointers):

Put two runners (slow and fast) at the start.

slow takes 1 step at a time, fast takes 2 steps at a time.

When fast reaches the end, slow is standing right in the middle!

Reverse the second half:

Take the list from slow to the end and reverse all its arrows in-place (turning 2 -> 1 into 1 -> 2).

Compare both halves:

Start one pointer at the beginning (head) and another at the start of the reversed second half.

Walk step-by-step to see if every number matches. If all match, it's a palindrome!


Time Complexity:O(N)
